{
  "slug": "masthead-data",
  "name": "Masthead Data",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connects Claude with Masthead Data to optimize BigQuery costs and analyze and fix data incidents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `masthead-compute-savings-with-data-models` (Optimize BigQuery compute costs by assigning data models (Dataform, dbt, Airflow) to slot reservations or on-demand compute based…), `masthead-compute-savings-with-pipelines` (Optimize BigQuery compute costs by identifying and pausing/disabling unused, dead-end, or inefficient pipelines that consume compute resources), `masthead-incident-triaging` (Triage, analyze downstream impact, and mitigate data quality and pipeline incidents using the Masthead MCP server), `masthead-storage-savings-with-datasets` (Optimize BigQuery storage costs at the dataset level by switching storage billing models and setting expiration policies), `masthead-storage-savings-with-tables` (Optimize BigQuery storage costs by identifying and removing dead-end and unused tables)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `masthead`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install masthead-data@claude-community` from `masthead-data/for-agents`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
